@startuml
[*] --> Start
Start --> CreatingLearningPath : Begin creating learning path
CreatingLearningPath --> AccessingContent : Learning path created
AccessingContent --> AccessingContent : Accessing more content
AccessingContent --> ReceivingRecommendations : Request recommendations
ReceivingRecommendations --> ReceivingRecommendations : Receiving more recommendations
ReceivingRecommendations --> TrackingProgress : Track progress
TrackingProgress --> TrackingProgress : Continue tracking
TrackingProgress --> CreatingLearningPath : Switch learning path
TrackingProgress --> [*] : Exit
@enduml
